%% SEQ-08: Read-only dashboard and audit projection
%% Behavior trace is in 02_Requirements/AIOS_Requirement_Behavior_Traceability.csv
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Viewer as Sysadmin / SRE
    participant UI as Read-only Dashboard
    participant API as Projection API
    participant TDB as Telemetry/Decision SQLite DB
    participant ADB as Separate Audit SQLite DB
    Viewer->>UI: Open status and history
    UI->>API: Request read-only projection
    API->>TDB: Query metrics, predictions, mode and outcomes
    TDB-->>API: Values with source/time/quality state
    API->>ADB: Query audit summary and integrity status
    ADB-->>API: Correlated summaries and chain status
    API->>API: Apply privacy projection and redact sensitive fields
    API-->>UI: Status, recommendations, health and outcomes
    UI-->>Viewer: Show zero vs unavailable/stale/degraded/warming-up/denied
    Note over UI,API: No actuator socket, command, approval or mode-change route
